WEBVTT

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:02.980
The Digital World,

00:00:02.980 --> 00:00:06.040
a world inhabited by unusual 
creatures called Digimon.

00:00:06.040 --> 00:00:09.950
It has been conquered 
by the evil Bagra Army

00:00:09.950 --> 00:00:14.510
and divided into seven Kingdoms 
ruled by seven Death Generals.

00:00:15.170 --> 00:00:18.300
Taiki Kudou has leapt 
into these seven Kingdoms

00:00:18.300 --> 00:00:22.040
along with his partner, 
Shoutmon, to save the Digimon.

00:00:22.600 --> 00:00:25.720
This is the story of the 
friendship and adventures

00:00:25.720 --> 00:00:28.540
shared by Taiki, his friends, 
and the Digimon.

00:01:51.290 --> 00:01:53.790
In the fifth Kingdom, Gold Land,

00:01:53.790 --> 00:01:55.750
Ballistamon was turned 
into a destructive weapon.

00:01:56.590 --> 00:02:00.930
But his bond with his best friend returned 
his heart to the side of justice.

00:02:01.430 --> 00:02:04.310
We defeated the Death General, Olegmon,

00:02:04.310 --> 00:02:07.670
and headed for the sixth 
Kingdom, Canyon Land.

00:02:09.810 --> 00:02:18.370
<b>Whispering to Kiriha!</b>

00:02:10.510 --> 00:02:18.370
<b>The Earth God General of the Canyon, The Devil's Temptation!</b>

00:02:12.460 --> 00:02:14.230
Whispering to Kiriha!

00:02:14.230 --> 00:02:17.550
The Earth God General of the Canyon, 
The Devil's Temptation!

00:02:23.490 --> 00:02:25.590
Canyon Land, huh?

00:02:26.570 --> 00:02:30.730
The next Death General 
is beyond that gate.

00:02:31.440 --> 00:02:34.150
Isn't there some way 
to see inside the gate?

00:02:34.710 --> 00:02:36.370
We'll try.

00:02:37.790 --> 00:02:40.240
It appears they're about 
to climb the castle wall.

00:02:44.710 --> 00:02:46.040
Gaze...

00:02:50.450 --> 00:02:52.650
There are tons of them!

00:02:54.390 --> 00:02:58.320
How do we fight an army that big?

00:02:58.870 --> 00:03:01.790
Two hundred Hippogryphomon that can fly.

00:03:01.790 --> 00:03:04.900
Three hundred Cerberumon, 
the guard dogs of hell.

00:03:05.290 --> 00:03:08.730
Five hundred Wendigomon with 
abnormal destructive power.

00:03:08.730 --> 00:03:11.800
And guarded by two Anubimon,

00:03:11.800 --> 00:03:15.610
the Death General, 
Gravimon the Earth God.

00:03:15.610 --> 00:03:18.140
The one we're going to defeat.

00:03:18.630 --> 00:03:21.280
No... the one <i>I'll</i> defeat.

00:03:21.280 --> 00:03:24.650
Thank you for gathering here today, men.

00:03:24.650 --> 00:03:28.520
As you know, the humans have 
broken through the fifth Kingdom

00:03:28.520 --> 00:03:30.020
and are on their way here.

00:03:30.020 --> 00:03:35.330
However, seeing all my 
forces here, I am confident.

00:03:35.960 --> 00:03:39.310
Victory will be ours!

00:03:49.040 --> 00:03:52.360
With an army that strong, 
a direct confrontation won't work.

00:03:52.360 --> 00:03:56.600
Then should we sneak in as 
usual and take out Gravimon?

00:03:56.600 --> 00:03:59.770
They've foreseen that strategy.

00:04:00.450 --> 00:04:02.990
This time, I'll take charge.

00:04:02.990 --> 00:04:05.290
What's with you all of a sudden?

00:04:05.290 --> 00:04:08.090
Do you have something in mind, Kiriha?

00:04:08.090 --> 00:04:12.180
There's only one thing 
we'll need for this battle.

00:04:12.180 --> 00:04:14.370
And what would that be?

00:04:14.790 --> 00:04:16.600
Strength.

00:04:16.600 --> 00:04:17.910
Strength?

00:04:17.910 --> 00:04:19.040
Kiriha...

00:04:19.040 --> 00:04:21.540
That's right. Unequivocal strength.

00:04:24.370 --> 00:04:26.040
This is our strategy.

00:04:26.040 --> 00:04:27.820
This is the enemy castle wall.

00:04:27.820 --> 00:04:31.650
There are two valleys between 
it and our current location.

00:04:31.650 --> 00:04:33.820
First, Nene's team...

00:04:35.220 --> 00:04:37.470
You'll attack the wall from the air.

00:04:37.470 --> 00:04:41.340
Then, they'll send in the 
flying Hippogryphomon.

00:04:42.690 --> 00:04:44.660
Next, Taiki's team...

00:04:45.880 --> 00:04:49.150
Those who can move quickly will 
enter the valley on the right.

00:04:49.150 --> 00:04:52.650
They'll send in the 
quick-moving Cerberumon.

00:04:53.970 --> 00:04:56.210
And the ones with power...

00:04:57.700 --> 00:04:59.230
...will enter the valley on the left.

00:04:59.230 --> 00:05:02.280
They'll send in the powerful Wendigomon.

00:05:05.930 --> 00:05:07.790
What about your team, Kiriha?

00:05:08.310 --> 00:05:10.050
As for my team...

00:05:10.050 --> 00:05:13.740
The only remaining enemy force 
is the Death General, Gravimon.

00:05:15.530 --> 00:05:17.100
That's where I'll be.

00:05:17.100 --> 00:05:18.560
Why?!

00:05:18.560 --> 00:05:21.850
That means you get all the fun parts!

00:05:21.850 --> 00:05:24.840
Plus, if the rest of us 
are fighting separately,

00:05:24.840 --> 00:05:26.500
we won't last long.

00:05:26.500 --> 00:05:27.640
Ten minutes.

00:05:28.340 --> 00:05:30.820
You only need to hold 
out for ten minutes.

00:05:31.570 --> 00:05:34.210
Just hold the enemy off for ten minutes,

00:05:35.490 --> 00:05:38.850
and I'll strike down Gravimon.

00:05:41.680 --> 00:05:44.750
What if we can't hold out?

00:05:44.750 --> 00:05:47.290
He's right. This is 
a dangerous strategy.

00:05:47.290 --> 00:05:48.830
We'll all be...

00:05:48.830 --> 00:05:50.420
This is pointless.

00:05:50.420 --> 00:05:53.590
Why talk about losing before 
we even begin to fight?

00:05:53.590 --> 00:05:55.220
Weakness is evil.

00:05:55.220 --> 00:05:57.310
Come hell or high water, you must win.

00:05:57.310 --> 00:05:58.800
Those who can't win are garbage.

00:05:58.800 --> 00:06:00.550
What'd you say?!

00:06:01.210 --> 00:06:03.890
Why? Why are you in such a hurry?

00:06:04.490 --> 00:06:06.190
We're near the goal.

00:06:07.180 --> 00:06:11.280
So I'll fight for my true objective.

00:06:11.870 --> 00:06:14.290
Your true objective?

00:06:14.620 --> 00:06:19.560
Yes. I will prove here 
that I am the strongest.

00:06:19.560 --> 00:06:21.090
The strongest?

00:06:22.210 --> 00:06:26.260
You mean to defeat the 
Bagra Army, right?

00:06:26.800 --> 00:06:29.730
You can interpret it 
that way if you want.

00:06:30.970 --> 00:06:32.840
Just remember...

00:06:33.140 --> 00:06:37.750
If it's necessary in order to 
prove I'm the strongest,

00:06:38.580 --> 00:06:40.510
I will show no mercy, even to you.

00:06:44.510 --> 00:06:46.580
Hey, Kiriha!

00:06:46.580 --> 00:06:48.710
What are you saying?

00:06:48.710 --> 00:06:51.280
That's fine with me, Kiriha.

00:06:52.560 --> 00:06:54.160
Fine?! But, Taiki!

00:06:55.620 --> 00:06:57.920
I trust Kiriha.

00:06:57.920 --> 00:06:59.930
He wouldn't do something like that.

00:07:00.460 --> 00:07:02.540
I believe Kiriha is our friend.

00:07:02.540 --> 00:07:04.140
I'll fight with him.

00:07:06.070 --> 00:07:07.310
Whatever.

00:07:08.590 --> 00:07:11.510
Let's fight with your strategy, Kiriha.

00:07:12.510 --> 00:07:14.580
So we can defeat the Bagra Army,

00:07:14.580 --> 00:07:16.490
and the Death General 
of the sixth Kingdom.

00:07:18.620 --> 00:07:20.300
Let's fight together.

00:07:31.070 --> 00:07:32.730
I see you're on the move,

00:07:32.730 --> 00:07:34.130
Kiriha.

00:07:34.760 --> 00:07:36.030
Go!

00:07:48.470 --> 00:07:51.580
They're coming, Nene! There's so many!

00:07:51.580 --> 00:07:53.150
Don't complain!

00:07:53.150 --> 00:07:53.940
Let's go!

00:07:53.940 --> 00:07:55.390
Right!

00:07:57.360 --> 00:07:59.990
Don't do anything reckless, Nene.

00:07:59.990 --> 00:08:02.530
First, the battle in the air.

00:08:07.940 --> 00:08:09.780
Are you okay, Nene?

00:08:09.780 --> 00:08:10.770
We're just getting started!

00:08:15.670 --> 00:08:17.940
Sparrowmon, I need you to DigiXros!

00:08:17.940 --> 00:08:19.610
Okay!

00:08:19.610 --> 00:08:21.850
Reload, Mervamon!

00:08:25.250 --> 00:08:27.150
Sparrowmon! Mervamon!

00:08:27.530 --> 00:08:28.800
DigiXros!

00:08:29.890 --> 00:08:31.490
DigiXros!

00:08:45.240 --> 00:08:47.240
JetMervamon!

00:08:51.470 --> 00:08:52.990
Use Love Poison!

00:08:59.150 --> 00:09:00.700
There are too many of them!

00:09:00.700 --> 00:09:01.790
This will never end!

00:09:05.740 --> 00:09:06.990
<i>Kiriha!</i>

00:09:06.990 --> 00:09:08.430
<i>Fine work.</i>

00:09:08.430 --> 00:09:10.830
<i>Bringing them to me was 
all I needed you to do.</i>

00:09:10.830 --> 00:09:12.510
Giga Destroyer!

00:09:15.570 --> 00:09:18.200
Hey! We're still in—

00:09:22.810 --> 00:09:24.280
What was that?

00:09:24.280 --> 00:09:25.610
He'd attack us along with them?

00:09:26.990 --> 00:09:29.780
Look around you! 
There are still enemies left!

00:09:32.890 --> 00:09:36.050
Spicy Hard Love!

00:09:37.210 --> 00:09:38.820
The rest are all yours!

00:09:42.090 --> 00:09:42.960
Here they come!

00:09:45.470 --> 00:09:46.430
Let's go!

00:09:49.230 --> 00:09:51.040
Looks like it's underway here, too.

00:09:57.180 --> 00:09:59.550
They've gathered plenty of them now.

00:10:00.260 --> 00:10:03.310
Reload, Deckerdramon!

00:10:09.420 --> 00:10:11.240
Deckerdra-Launcher!

00:10:17.830 --> 00:10:18.870
What?!

00:10:18.870 --> 00:10:20.060
Barrier!

00:10:33.230 --> 00:10:35.330
What kind of battle tactic is that?

00:10:37.570 --> 00:10:39.680
There are still some left!

00:10:46.240 --> 00:10:48.360
Looks like they're having trouble here.

00:10:57.450 --> 00:10:59.400
You're taking them too lightly, Taiki!

00:11:00.250 --> 00:11:03.540
We need to confuse the enemy, 
with as little fighting as possible.

00:11:06.580 --> 00:11:09.350
Our role is to draw the enemy to us.

00:11:10.210 --> 00:11:13.910
I'm itching to just wipe them 
all out as fast as we can!

00:11:14.890 --> 00:11:16.550
MetalGreymon?

00:11:16.550 --> 00:11:17.260
What?

00:11:20.560 --> 00:11:22.800
Steadily take away their forces.

00:11:22.800 --> 00:11:24.600
That's how I fight.

00:11:25.000 --> 00:11:27.320
Is he trying to burn the whole 
forest with the enemy in it?

00:11:27.320 --> 00:11:29.200
Hot, hot, hot!

00:11:36.220 --> 00:11:37.230
Taiki!

00:11:37.230 --> 00:11:39.390
Dorulumon! You came!

00:11:39.970 --> 00:11:41.550
Time to DigiXros!

00:11:46.890 --> 00:11:48.250
Shoutmon!

00:11:48.250 --> 00:11:49.790
Okay!

00:11:49.790 --> 00:11:51.090
Ballistamon!

00:11:52.520 --> 00:11:53.830
Dorulumon!

00:11:55.160 --> 00:11:55.960
Starmons!

00:11:55.960 --> 00:11:57.370
Yes!

00:11:58.560 --> 00:12:00.160
DigiXros!

00:12:02.090 --> 00:12:04.980
Shoutmon X4!

00:12:13.170 --> 00:12:14.480
That was a close call.

00:12:16.250 --> 00:12:18.980
Taiki, I'm gonna go 
nuts on them this time!

00:12:18.980 --> 00:12:19.880
Yeah!

00:12:21.340 --> 00:12:22.390
Kiriha...

00:12:28.530 --> 00:12:31.720
Now most of the enemy forces are gone.

00:12:31.720 --> 00:12:32.560
All that's left is...

00:12:39.470 --> 00:12:42.210
It's too late to go 
on the defensive now.

00:12:43.570 --> 00:12:44.810
You won't get away from me!

00:12:59.140 --> 00:13:01.660
Reload, Deckerdramon!

00:13:12.640 --> 00:13:14.960
Prepare yourself, 
Gravimon the Earth God!

00:13:15.660 --> 00:13:17.120
So you've come at last.

00:13:17.810 --> 00:13:19.610
Are you making light of this battle?!

00:13:20.070 --> 00:13:23.510
I can't believe you're still sitting 
on that throne amidst all this.

00:13:24.690 --> 00:13:26.750
Stay out of my way, weaklings!

00:13:33.460 --> 00:13:37.160
How interesting, 
coming at me by yourself.

00:13:37.160 --> 00:13:38.330
However...

00:13:44.800 --> 00:13:45.400
What?

00:13:50.340 --> 00:13:51.660
DigiXros!

00:13:51.660 --> 00:13:54.280
MailBirdramon! Greymon!

00:13:56.580 --> 00:13:58.920
MetalGreymon!

00:14:00.360 --> 00:14:01.690
MetalGreymon!

00:14:01.690 --> 00:14:02.770
Digivolve!

00:14:04.130 --> 00:14:08.290
MetalGreymon, Digivolve!

00:14:10.330 --> 00:14:13.500
ZekeGreymon!

00:14:16.730 --> 00:14:19.100
This is the power of Kiriha Aonuma?

00:14:25.810 --> 00:14:26.960
Kiriha!

00:14:29.060 --> 00:14:30.650
It's over.

00:14:30.650 --> 00:14:32.160
We've...

00:14:32.720 --> 00:14:35.090
No, I've won.

00:14:35.980 --> 00:14:38.290
ZekeGreymon, finish him!

00:14:39.690 --> 00:14:41.290
The end.

00:14:45.130 --> 00:14:47.630
Well done, Kiriha.

00:14:47.630 --> 00:14:48.670
What?!

00:14:48.670 --> 00:14:52.560
But this has all been 
according to my strategy.

00:14:53.300 --> 00:14:57.040
What? Didn't he defeat Gravimon?

00:14:59.910 --> 00:15:01.550
Wha—

00:15:02.000 --> 00:15:06.700
You only defeated a 
small part of my forces.

00:15:07.310 --> 00:15:08.450
It can't be...

00:15:08.450 --> 00:15:10.160
Behold.

00:15:10.160 --> 00:15:12.510
This is my true strength,

00:15:12.510 --> 00:15:15.990
my full fighting force!

00:15:26.700 --> 00:15:30.110
Wh-What do we do? 
We're surrounded!

00:15:35.460 --> 00:15:36.830
I...

00:15:42.300 --> 00:15:43.790
I haven't lost yet!

00:15:44.200 --> 00:15:46.120
Kiriha! Stop!

00:15:46.120 --> 00:15:48.380
Go, ZekeGreymon!

00:15:49.460 --> 00:15:52.400
Stop! We've lost this battle!

00:15:53.970 --> 00:15:56.070
I won't accept that!

00:15:56.070 --> 00:15:57.770
I will win!

00:15:57.770 --> 00:15:59.030
What's this?

00:15:59.030 --> 00:16:01.970
You still approach me?

00:16:01.970 --> 00:16:03.570
It's all meaningless if I don't win!

00:16:03.570 --> 00:16:05.340
I can see it, Kiriha...

00:16:05.680 --> 00:16:08.810
Those who aren't strong 
have no right to live!

00:16:08.810 --> 00:16:11.180
The darkness inside you.

00:16:11.180 --> 00:16:12.320
I...

00:16:14.080 --> 00:16:19.020
Your heart, surrounded by darkness.

00:16:23.910 --> 00:16:27.020
High Gravity Pressure!

00:16:33.370 --> 00:16:35.370
You still don't get it?

00:16:35.370 --> 00:16:38.410
You've lost, Kiriha.

00:16:39.480 --> 00:16:40.470
I've...

00:16:41.490 --> 00:16:42.710
lost?

00:16:45.480 --> 00:16:46.660
Kiriha...

00:16:48.520 --> 00:16:50.820
Taiki, are you there?

00:16:50.820 --> 00:16:52.620
Nene! Are you okay?

00:16:52.620 --> 00:16:53.890
Where are you?

00:16:55.630 --> 00:16:56.820
Right above you.

00:16:56.820 --> 00:16:58.160
What are you going to do now?

00:16:58.160 --> 00:17:00.260
Nene, fire at us.

00:17:00.260 --> 00:17:01.870
What?

00:17:01.870 --> 00:17:03.500
Use Ouroboros Gate.

00:17:03.500 --> 00:17:05.140
Trust me.

00:17:05.140 --> 00:17:08.210
It's the only way we'll get out of this.

00:17:15.350 --> 00:17:17.380
Nice, JetMervamon!

00:17:25.350 --> 00:17:27.380
A clever move.

00:17:27.910 --> 00:17:28.960
However...

00:17:30.140 --> 00:17:31.340
I...

00:17:38.380 --> 00:17:40.200
We're safe, somehow.

00:17:40.340 --> 00:17:43.070
Yeah. Thank goodness this 
groundwater was here.

00:17:43.400 --> 00:17:45.480
You knew there was groundwater here?

00:17:45.790 --> 00:17:46.440
Yeah.

00:17:47.010 --> 00:17:50.050
I noticed it when Kiriha 
attacked in the valley.

00:17:50.820 --> 00:17:52.520
By the way, where is Kiriha?

00:17:52.520 --> 00:17:54.880
Oh, he's not here.

00:17:55.540 --> 00:17:57.320
Surely he wasn't too slow getting away?

00:17:57.320 --> 00:17:59.320
No way... Kiriha is...

00:18:15.230 --> 00:18:17.380
<i>You lost.</i>

00:18:17.860 --> 00:18:20.160
<i>You came back a loser.</i>

00:18:21.060 --> 00:18:23.180
<i>Weakness is evil.</i>

00:18:23.180 --> 00:18:25.320
<i>Those who can't win are garbage.</i>

00:18:27.330 --> 00:18:31.170
<i>Those who aren't strong 
have no right to live.</i>

00:18:31.170 --> 00:18:31.720
<i>I...</i>

00:18:32.170 --> 00:18:34.510
<i>You are a loser.</i>

00:18:38.760 --> 00:18:40.080
Dad...

00:18:45.870 --> 00:18:49.020
I can see the darkness in your heart.

00:18:49.600 --> 00:18:50.610
Gravimon!

00:18:51.690 --> 00:18:54.270
Why are you here?!

00:18:54.270 --> 00:18:56.450
Now, hold on.

00:18:56.450 --> 00:19:00.420
I only came to tell you something.

00:19:00.420 --> 00:19:01.950
Tell me something?

00:19:01.950 --> 00:19:03.390
Yes.

00:19:03.390 --> 00:19:05.250
Did you know?

00:19:05.250 --> 00:19:10.320
It was Lord Bagramon who called 
you to the Digital World.

00:19:10.320 --> 00:19:11.750
Bagramon?!

00:19:12.340 --> 00:19:15.250
He wanted your strength.

00:19:15.250 --> 00:19:19.440
He wanted you to be a Death General.

00:19:19.440 --> 00:19:21.770
He needed my strength?

00:19:22.330 --> 00:19:23.800
Quite the opposite.

00:19:24.770 --> 00:19:29.530
You attacked us recklessly and lost.

00:19:30.750 --> 00:19:34.010
If Taiki Kudou hadn't 
made that brave decision,

00:19:34.010 --> 00:19:35.620
you all would have been done for.

00:19:35.620 --> 00:19:38.120
No! He ran away!

00:19:38.120 --> 00:19:39.990
You don't understand.

00:19:39.990 --> 00:19:40.760
What?!

00:19:40.760 --> 00:19:45.200
Taiki Kudou alone is our enemy now.

00:19:45.200 --> 00:19:47.430
Not you.

00:19:48.010 --> 00:19:52.640
There is no need for weaklings 
like you in the Digital World.

00:19:52.640 --> 00:19:55.310
I'm... weak?

00:19:55.980 --> 00:19:58.910
I'm... not needed?

00:19:58.910 --> 00:20:00.580
Weakness is evil.

00:20:00.580 --> 00:20:02.610
Those who can't win are garbage.

00:20:03.380 --> 00:20:06.460
Those who aren't strong 
have no right to live.

00:20:06.880 --> 00:20:11.220
You are a loser.

00:20:12.960 --> 00:20:15.390
You are a loser.

00:20:23.950 --> 00:20:25.400
Broken at last, have you?

00:20:26.870 --> 00:20:27.510
No.

00:20:29.810 --> 00:20:31.800
I don't want to lose.

00:20:31.800 --> 00:20:34.510
I don't want to be a loser!

00:20:34.510 --> 00:20:36.540
I'll become stronger.

00:20:36.540 --> 00:20:38.450
I will become stronger!

00:20:39.180 --> 00:20:42.320
I'll do anything to be stronger.

00:20:42.320 --> 00:20:45.640
Oh? Interesting. Anything, eh?

00:20:45.640 --> 00:20:49.130
Yes. I'll do anything,

00:20:49.130 --> 00:20:52.420
if it would prove my strength.

00:20:55.170 --> 00:20:58.420
Then let's see you prove it.

00:20:58.420 --> 00:21:02.340
Defeat the one who can 
prove your true strength.

00:21:03.520 --> 00:21:04.600
Yes...

00:21:05.220 --> 00:21:09.240
By defeating Taiki Kudou...

00:21:09.240 --> 00:21:10.540
Taiki?

00:21:12.900 --> 00:21:15.690
A path I would have had 
to take eventually.

00:21:16.230 --> 00:21:17.570
Very well.

00:21:17.570 --> 00:21:20.260
I will defeat Taiki Kudou,

00:21:20.260 --> 00:21:22.490
and prove that I am strong.

00:21:27.970 --> 00:21:29.100
Hang tight, Kiriha!

00:21:29.100 --> 00:21:30.720
Just until we get there!

00:21:36.790 --> 00:21:39.460
It's the Canyon Land sunrise...

00:21:50.510 --> 00:21:52.460
Kiriha! You're okay!

00:21:53.020 --> 00:21:54.830
Taiki.

00:21:55.260 --> 00:21:57.700
I've come to defeat you.

00:21:57.700 --> 00:21:58.660
What?

00:21:59.260 --> 00:22:00.970
Giga Destroyer!

00:22:04.010 --> 00:22:07.540
To prove that I am strong.

00:22:07.540 --> 00:22:08.760
<b>To Be Continued</b>

