00:22:21.090 --> 00:22:38.640
<b>Dinosaur Type</b>

00:22:21.920 --> 00:22:32.700
<b>[Attacks]</b>

00:22:23.350 --> 00:22:38.640
<b>Splatter Hunting  
Ogre Flame</b>

00:22:26.190 --> 00:22:27.790
Dinorexmon.

00:22:27.790 --> 00:22:30.230
His attack is Splatter Hunting.

00:22:30.230 --> 00:22:32.940
His sharp claws are his 
distinguishing feature.

00:22:32.940 --> 00:22:35.500
Aren't they a little too long?

00:22:35.500 --> 00:22:38.640
Someone bring the clippers!

00:22:40.540 --> 00:22:43.840
By defeating Taiki, I'll earn 
the title of the strongest!

00:22:43.840 --> 00:22:47.110
The strength you speak 
of is not true strength!

00:22:47.110 --> 00:22:49.950
I will teach you if it costs me my life!

00:22:49.950 --> 00:22:51.250
Digimon Xros Wars!

00:22:51.250 --> 00:22:53.470
<b>With Strong Love!</b>

00:22:51.250 --> 00:22:53.470
<b>Deckerdramon's Final Shout!!</b>

00:22:51.650 --> 00:22:53.520
You can't turn your back 
on the next one, either!
